      "narration_text": "Two point five is defined in one sentence: the full two point oh scope plus an M C P interface for talking to Medhavy. M C P, the Model Context Protocol, lets A I assistants call an application's tools in a standard way. Everything else in the twelve-line README is pointers back to the two point oh plan.",
