      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "WORKED_EXAMPLE",
      "narration_text": "My first idea: start with read-only tools that wrap what the hub already does. Search a textbook the user can access. Look up a glossary term, since that A P I exists. List my classes. And deliberately no write tools at first. Publishing should stay inside two point oh's review workflow, where a human approves every exact revision.",
